{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only multiprofile setup using scvi_n200 RNA encoder and avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6501 and F1 of 0.6275. The results suggest the RNA encoder may contribute to performance, but the relative impact of multimodal components (image encoder, fusion) versus the RNA encoder alone remains uncertain, as the previous multimodal setup (config_036) achieved higher accuracy. Further experiments are needed to isolate these factors."
}

